OL,3,CSearches for second-hand bridesmaid
OL,4,Cdresses up 17% year on year ` Vinted
OL,6,FSearches for second-hand bridesmaid
OL,7,Fdresses are up 17% year on year as
OL,8,Fwoman baulk at the cost of performing
OL,9,Fthe honour, figures from resale
OL,10,Fplatform Vinted suggest.
OL,12,FAlmost a quarter of women who have
OL,13,Fbeen a bridesmaid (24%) have
OL,14,Fconsidered turning down the role
OL,15,Fbecause of the cost, rising to more
OL,16,Fthan one in three (35%) among women
OL,17,Faged 25 to 34, a survey for the online
OL,18,Fmarketplace found.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
