OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785714477
OL,3,CSearches for second-hand bridesmaid
OL,4,Cdresses up 17% year on year ` Vinted
OL,6,FAlmost six in 10 women who had already
OL,7,Fbeen a bridesmaid (59%) said the role
OL,8,Fcost more than they expected, while
OL,9,Fone in three (33%) spent between #250
OL,10,Fand #499 at their most recent wedding.
OL,12,FMore than one in three (36%) paid for
OL,13,Ftheir own bridesmaid dress or outfit,
OL,14,Frising to almost half (46%) of women
OL,15,Faged 25 to 34 ` and more than half
OL,16,F(52%) of those in London.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
