OL,3,CSearches for second-hand bridesmaid
OL,4,Cdresses up 17% year on year ` Vinted
OL,6,FAmong former bridesmaids who have not
OL,7,Fworn their dress again, the biggest
OL,8,Freason was simply not having another
OL,9,Foccasion to wear it (42%), while one
OL,10,Fin four (25%) said the dress felt too
OL,11,Frecognisable from the wedding itself.
OL,13,FNearly two thirds (63%) of women who
OL,14,Fhave been bridesmaids say they would
OL,15,Ffeel comfortable wearing a bridesmaid
OL,16,Fdress that had already been worn,
OL,17,Frising to 70% among women aged 25 to
OL,18,F34.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
