OL,3,CSearches for second-hand bridesmaid
OL,4,Cdresses up 17% year on year ` Vinted
OL,6,FMore than one in three (34%) of women
OL,7,Fwho have attended a wedding have
OL,8,Falready worn a second-hand outfit to
OL,9,Fthe event, with saving money (69%),
OL,10,Favoiding buying something they will
OL,11,Fonly wear once (38%) and finding
OL,12,Fbetter quality pieces for less (35%)
OL,13,Famong the biggest reasons.
OL,15,FSome 80% of women agreed it was
OL,16,F"perfectly acceptable" to resell a
OL,17,Fbridesmaid dress after the wedding.
