OL,3,CSearches for second-hand bridesmaid
OL,4,Cdresses up 17% year on year ` Vinted
OL,6,FFormal dressed are listed on Vinted
OL,7,Ffor an average #11, with the most
OL,8,Fsearched-for bridesmaid dress colours
OL,9,Fbeing green, pink and blue.
OL,11,FEuan Steedman, UK communications lead
OL,12,Fat Vinted, said: "Being asked to be a
OL,13,Fbridesmaid is a special moment, but
OL,14,Four research shows that the cost of
OL,15,Ftaking part is leaving some women
OL,16,Fquestioning whether they can afford to
OL,17,Fsay yes.
