OL,3,CSearches for second-hand bridesmaid
OL,4,Cdresses up 17% year on year ` Vinted
OL,6,F"More than one in three women have
OL,7,Falready worn a second-hand outfit to a
OL,8,Fwedding, showing that people are
OL,9,Fincreasingly looking for ways to
OL,10,Fcelebrate these important moments
OL,11,Fwithout compromising on style or
OL,12,Fspending more than they need to."
OL,14,FThink BF surveyed 2,000 UK women in
OL,15,FJuly 2026.
